    <!-- Hint reasons (UI_SPEC.md "Hint Presentation"): one coach's sentence per spot. %1$d and %2$d are numbers (see each). -->
    <string name="hint_reason_premium_raise">顶级好牌：加注来做大底池，你很可能领先。</string>
    <string name="hint_reason_late_position_raise">后位，你在大多数玩家之后行动：现在加注可能直接赢下盲注。</string>
    <string name="hint_reason_playable_raise">这个位置的好牌：加注可以在下注中占据主动。</string>
